music BGM01.mp3
text I slip out of there as soon as I can, under the pretense of taking an afternoon nap.
text I sit down on a bench in the courtyard, and do nothing.
text I'm a bit annoyed.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Even if he's an idiot, I could at least tease him...)
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Damn it.
text It's a little shocking that I'm thinking of helping Sunohara...
text But I do feel I need to do something... for Mei-chan, as well.
text I wonder if there's anything I can do to help.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Still, just what am I supposed to do...?)
text Why'd that guy get like this in the first place?
text Naturally, part of it is because he's been going crazy ever since he's been with Sanae-san.
text However, I should try thinking about it from a more fundamental point of view...
text So I decide to think about it from step one.
text @[Tomoya]
text (He'd entered this school under a sports recommendation...)
text However, he became unable to participate in his usual club activities...
text His grades then rapidly dropped, and he stopped going to classes...
text And in the end, he became a habitual latecomer, and even gave up on going to university.
text And then, he started living his day to day life idly, doing nothing.
text @[Tomoya]
text (It's actually completely the same for me, isn't it...?)
text It's something I already knew, but once again, I feel at my wits' end.
text @[Tomoya]
text (He truly is a hateful guy...)
text So in the end, I was made to realise that he and I really are the same.
text Though that also means that if I look back at myself, I might figure out a way to understand him.
text I rouse myself, and put my brain to work.
text @[Tomoya]
text (When did everything become such a hassle for me...?)
text @[Tomoya]
text (I guess it was around the time I stopped my club activities.)
text @[Tomoya]
text (In that case, the same's probably true for Sunohara...)
text ...However, there was one thing that was different between us.
