text (Maybe things would change if he joined the soccer club again...?)
text I immediately drown out that thought, along with a bitter smile.
text There's no way he could show his face there after all this time.
text He himself probably wouldn't agree to it, either.
text Not to mention the soccer club would never accept him back to begin with...
text ...However, no matter how much I thought about this, that's the only thing that comes to mind.
